===Errors===
* When {{p|Pichu}} first emerges from [[Lyn]]'s bag, the clip is oval like Bonnie's bag instead of diamond-shaped.
* When Pichu is hit by {{AP|Pikachu}}'s {{m|Thunderbolt}}, the back of its ears appear the same as the front instead of being all black. This error is repeated in later scenes.
* In the first shot of Dedenne sleeping in the toy store, the {{p|Cubchoo}} plush toy's muzzle is white instead of blue.
* During the Pokémon Holo Caster segment, the triangles on Chespin's cheeks disappear when {{an|Professor Oak}} touches its spikes.

